  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7202.02 “Breakage” means the odd cents of all redistribution based on each dollar wagered on HHR exceeding a sum equal to the next lowest multiple of 10 cents.\n\nSource. #14503, eff 2-4-26, EXPIRES: 2-4-36",
